# The sdk compiler, built by toolchain builds with the reference's gcc, or
# Fedora's (gcc-host) without one. gmp, mpfr and mpc are built in its tree
# and linked in statically, as are libstdc++ and libgcc, so it runs on
# glibc only and a pos build can change any other library under it. The
# build also produces gcc-runtime, which gcc requires; a build does not
# need its own outputs to run.
pipeline toolchain
build-requires gcc pos-link
requires glibc gcc-runtime binutils linux-headers
with-sources gmp mpfr mpc
obsoletes gcc-host
outputs gcc-runtime
